ee tools</a><a href=\"/resources\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Downloads</a><a href=\"/compare\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Compare</a><a href=\"/blog\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Playbook</a></div><div class=\"w-full sm:w-[220px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-[11px]\"><span class=\"neb-label  mb-1\">Weekly GTM Drop</span><p class=\"font-body text-[13px] text-muted leading-[1.6]\">Real GTM experiments, every Monday.</p><form class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 mt-1\"><input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"your@email.com\" required=\"\" class=\"w-full font-body text-[13px] bg-surface-2 border border-rule rounded-lg px-3.5 py-2.5 outline-none focus:border-gold transition-colors text-ink placeholder:text-faint\" value=\"\"/><button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full bg-brand-gold text-brand-black font-body font-semibold text-[13px] rounded-lg py-2.5 hover:bg-brand-gold-dim transition-colors disabled:opacity-60\">Get weekly tips</button></form></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-[50px] pt-6 border-t border-rule flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-3\"><span class=\"font-body text-[12px] text-muted\">© 2026 Nebulaa. All rights reserved.</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-5\"><a href=\"/facts\" class=\"font-body text-[12px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Facts</a><a href=\"/privacy-policy\" class=\"font-body text-[12px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Privacy</a><a href=\"/terms\" class=\"font-body text-[12px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Terms</a></div></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-03f7c6bc932ce1e3.js\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0]);self.__next_f.push([2,null])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/91d486bf57bf1762.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n\"])<