text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"category: \\\\\\\"Comparisons\\\\\\\"\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"date: \\\\\\\"February 5, 2026\\\\\\\"\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"readTime: \\\\\\\"7 min read\\\\\\\"\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"author: \\\\\\\"Nebulaa Team\\\\\\\"\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"5\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h1\\\",\\\"6\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Nebulaa vs Buffer: Why a Scheduling Tool Isn't Enough for Growth\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"7\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"8\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Buffer is a good product. If you want to plan your social media calendar, schedule posts across platforms, and see basic analytics — it does exactly that, reliably and cleanly. There's a reason it's been around for over a decade and has millions of users.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"9\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"10\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"But if you're a founder trying to use content to generate leads, qualify them, and close pipeline — Buffer is a car without an engine. The dashboard is there. The wheels are there. But there's nothing that actually drives the outcome you're trying to reach.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"11\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"12\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Here's an honest comparison.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"13\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"14\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"What Buffer Does Well\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"15\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"16\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Buffer's core strength is scheduling and calendar management. You write or paste content, set a time, and it goes out. The UI is clean and the reliability is excellent — posts go out when they're supposed to, across LinkedIn, Instagram, Twitter/X, and Facebook.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"17\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"18\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The analytics show you reach, engagement, and follower growth over time. For teams that already have a content writer or a marketing hire, it's a solid publishing layer.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"19\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"20\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Buffer also has a decent team collaboration feature — you can have content writers draft, managers approve, and Buffer publish. For established teams with defined content workflows, this works well.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"21\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"22\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white my-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Buffer is genuinely a good tool if you have people to create the content.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"23\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"24\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"What Buffer Doesn't Do\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"25\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"26\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"This is where the gap starts to matter. Buffer is agnostic about your content. It does not:\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"27\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"28\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Write posts for you\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"29\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Learn your brand voice\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"30\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Understand what problems your product solves\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"31\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Track your competitors\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"32\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Suggest topics based on what's working in your category\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"33\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Know who your ideal customer is\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"34\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"35\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"It's a pipe, not a brain. You put content in one end; it comes out the other on a schedule. The intelligence — all of it — has to come from you or your team.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"36\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"37\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"For early-stage founders in India who are already wearing 7 hats, this is the problem. Buffer can't reduce the cognitive load of content creation — it can only make the distribution slightly easier.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"38\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"39\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"And then there's the other half of the equation: **what happens after someone sees your content?** Buffer stops at the post. It has no concept of who engaged, no ability to reach out to them, no follow-up mechanism, no lead qualification. It ends at impression.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"40\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"41\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The Gap: Content Creation + Lead Follow-Up\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"42\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"43\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The full content-to-revenue journey for a founder looks like this:\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"44\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"45\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"1. Create consistent, on-brand content\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"46\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"2. Publish it at the right time to the right platforms\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"47\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"3. Track who's engaging and showing buying intent\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"48\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"4. Follow up with those signals (DMs, WhatsApp, calls)\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"49\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"5. Qualify and route warm leads to a sales conversation\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"50\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"51\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Buffer handles step 2 (if you do step 1 yourself). It doesn't touch steps 3, 4, or 5.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"52\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"53\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Nebulaa handles all five. Gravity does steps 1 and 2 automatically. Pulsar handles steps 3, 4, and 5.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"54\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"55\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Feature Comparison\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"56\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"71\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"72\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Who Should Use Buffer\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"73\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"74\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Buffer makes sense if:\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"75\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"76\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"You have a dedicated content writer or marketing team who creates posts\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"77\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"You need a lightweight, low-cost publishing tool for an already-functional content workflow\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"78\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"You're managing multiple brands or clients and need a clean scheduling layer\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"79\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Your social media goal is brand awareness, not lead generation\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"80\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"81\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"For agencies, large teams with content resources, or personal brands that aren't selling a product — Buffer is a sensible choice.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"82\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"83\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Who Should Use Nebulaa\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"84\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"85\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Nebulaa makes sense if:\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"86\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"87\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"You're a founder or small team with no dedicated content person\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"88\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"You want social content to generate actual pipeline, not just followers\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"89\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"You need your content creation, publishing, and lead follow-up to work without constant manual input\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"90\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"You're targeting Indian SMB or startup audiences and want localised, culturally relevant content\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"91\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"You have leads coming in and no systematic way to qualify and follow up with them\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"92\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"93\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The pricing difference is real: Buffer is significantly cheaper. But the comparison only makes sense if you already have people to do the work Buffer doesn't do. If you don't, the \\\\\\\"cheap\\\\\\\" scheduling tool still requires you to solve the expensive content problem separately.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"94\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"95\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Conclusion\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"96\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"97\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Buffer is a scheduling tool. Nebulaa is a growth engine. They're not really competing for the same buyer.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"98\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"99\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"If you have a content team and just need reliable distribution, Buffer is fine. If you're a founder trying to build pipeline from content without a team to run it, Buffer solves the smallest part of your problem.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"100\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"101\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"102\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Key Takeaways\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"103\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"my-3\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"104\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Buffer excels at scheduling and distribution but requires you to create all content yourself\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"105\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"•\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Nebulaa generates the content, publishes it, and follows up on the leads it produces\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"106\\\",{\\\"className\\\